The catalog.json API metadata is derived from the publicly exposed Apache
Fineract OpenAPI 3 contract (API version and source digest are recorded in the
file). Apache Fineract is licensed under Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy
is included in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt. API field and route declarations are
transformed into native Odoo form contracts. No Apache Fineract server or
Mifos X Angular application source code is vendored in this addon.

Mifos X frontend source is used as a behavioral reference. Its revision and
file/line provenance are recorded in the project's parity inventory.
